 "intro_zh": "水洞沟是中国最早发掘的旧石器时代文化遗址。独特的雅丹地貌鬼斧神工地造就了魔鬼城、摩天崖、大峡谷等奇绝景观，它们和蓝天、碧水、断崖、芦苇、鸳鸯、野鸭共同构筑了宁静逸然的世外桃源。",
 "intro_en": "Shuidonggou is the earliest Paleolithic cultural site excavated in China. The unique Yadan landform and uncanny construction sites have created extraordinary landscapes such as Devil City, skyscraper cliffs, and grand canyons. Together with the blue sky, clear water, cliffs, reeds, mandarin ducks, and wild ducks, they create a peaceful paradise.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
